  "actual_input_contract": "Original learned_rollout(state, kappa, tape, base_option, q_reference) reads all four snapshot stores through original provider functions. Complete original v31 Q rows are the common referent, not a response quotient. Fixed START(0,2)/t0/m0/Pidentity, exact scene(k,phase,e0,r0,z), no mask/do, greedy strict argmax min action, reward_mode A. No training.",
