  "store_capture_contract": "The two original source main functions serialize ALL four actual stores through store_payload, before factual rollout and after each same-pre B1 arm. P/X are actually empty in this entire scope. Complete raw factual precedes truth and accepted complete record; arm payload and complete post store are in that original record. Bind full original raw/source/capture/row/arm slot and exact reference rows. Normalize entry ordering only, reject duplicate addresses, preserve every entry and original fingerprint. Q scalars use captured hex only, never recompute installer or B1 targets. No unobserved raw/fullstore is invented.",
  "scope_limits": "Closes ONLY both complete actual v38/v39 main branches with all factual/reference/treatment rollouts. Original NoWrite repeats/empty stores/success/failure and v38 adverse interactions retained. All other earlier/later complete or failed-prefix histories remain PENDING including v25 forwarded anchor, v24-v30/v34/v42-v45 and tests/validation/acquisition. v55 exact aliases, v56 baseline exclusion, v57 singleton index and v46/v47 references are not rerun. No ALL launch gate.",
